{"explanation":"Updates the socket-factory API to obtain platform trust managers from a TrustManagerFactory initialized with the default algorithm and a null KeyStore. The coordinated caller update must invoke the resulting no-argument factory method.","review_assumptions":["TrustManagerFactory.init has overloaded nullable Java signatures in Kotlin; the explicit KeyStore? cast disambiguates initialization with a null KeyStore without changing the configured trust-store source.","The coordinated edit to WebDavCompatibleHttpClient.kt updates the sole resolved SSLSocketFactories.from(trustManager) call to SSLSocketFactories.from()."],"no_change_required":false,"decision":"MULTI_FILE_FIX_PROPOSED_FOR_REVIEW","confidence":"high","edits":[{"source_file_path":"data/src/main/java/org/cryptomator/data/cloud/webdav/network/SSLSocketFactories.kt","original_code":"import java.security.GeneralSecurityException
import javax.net.ssl.SSLContext
